1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
[dramatic music playing]

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
[Killua] I beat him
right here and now,

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
or it's all over!

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
I've gotta protect Gon,
no matter what it takes!

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
[opening theme music playing]

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
[singer singing in English]

8
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

9
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
[singer singing in English]

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

11
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
[singer singing in English]

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

13
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
FRIEND X AND X JOURNEY

14
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,000
[narrator] Killua prepares
for a fight with a Chimera Ant,

15
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,000
fiercely determined
to protect Gon

16
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:01,000
for the 30 days
he is unable to use Nen.

17
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,000
However…

18
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
[chuckles]

19
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,000
[gasps]

20
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,000
[Illumi] Run.

21
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,000
[gasping]

22
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,000
[breathing shakily]

23
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:35,000
[laughing]

24
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Perfect! That's more like it,

25
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
that terrified expression.

26
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,000
I love that one!

27
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,000
[laughs] Oh, yeah.

28
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Now I really feel like killing you.

29
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,000
[laughs]

30
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:55,000
I'm gonna crush you
into a bloody pulp.

31
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:59,000
[Illumi] Avoid battles
you can't be sure you'll win.

32
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,000
[Killua] I have to protect him.

33
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,000
I have to!

34
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:06,000
[Illumi] When your enemy is unknown…

35
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,000
[Killua] Protect Gon…

36
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,000
[Illumi] …run away.

37
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,000
[Killua] No matter what happens!

38
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
[yells]

39
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,000
[gasps]

40
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
[shuddering]

41
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:33,000
-[serene music playing]
-[insects chirping]

42
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Mm?

43
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Is this tree special?

44
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,000
Just a little longer.

45
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,000
You'll see.

46
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,000
[sighs]

47
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,000
[chirping changes]

48
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,000
[gasps]

49
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,000
[gasps]

50
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,000
[both chuckle]

51
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Wow!

52
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,000
Sea fireflies.

53
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
They like to live near brackish water,

54
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,000
and it's breeding season.

55
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,000
[Palm] So pretty.

56
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,000
[Gon] Right?

57
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:03,000
[grunts]

58
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:06,000
[dramatic music playing]

59
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
[laughs]

60
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Look how scared you are.

61
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,000
Well?

62
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,000
[grunts] Now move!

63
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
You can't, can you? Hah!

64
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,000
Since you're frozen with fear!

65
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:28,000
-[laughing maniacally]
-[Killua grunts]

66
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:34,000
-[coughing]
-[sighs] Damn.

67
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,000
This feels incredible.

68
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:39,000
Should I kill him, or savor it?

69
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,000
I can't decide!

70
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,000
[roars]

71
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,000
[Killua grunting]

72
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,000
[Killua coughs]

73
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:49,000
[shuddering]

74
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,000
[insects chirping]

75
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,000
-[Gon] Here.
-Hmm?

76
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,000
It's a present,

77
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,000
the most beautiful flower
in the world.

78
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,000
[gasps]

79
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,000
Are you sure?

80
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,000
[chuckles]

81
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,000
Now don't move a muscle.

82
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:14,000
[serene music playing]

83
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:20,000
-[gasps]
-[serene music continues]

84
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,000
[Palm gasping]

85
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:39,000
The sap's similar
to the pheromones the fireflies emit,

86
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,000
and that's why they all flock to it.

87
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,000
Beautiful.

88
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,000
[sobbing]

89
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Thank you, Gon.

90
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:54,000
[Gon] Of course. I'm glad you like it.

91
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:58,000
But still, I just…

92
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:03,000
I'd like to give you what you want,
but I can't yet.

93
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,000
[Palm gasps]

94
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:06,000
What do you think I want?

95
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,000
Time to spend together.

96
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,000
[gasps]

97
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[laughs]

98
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,000
[Killua groans]

99
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:19,000
[Gon] It's just I want to get stronger,

100
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:23,000
strong enough to beat the Chimera Ants,

101
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:27,000
but to do that,
I've gotta train really, really hard.

102
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:32,000
Kite will be back in two days,

103
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:35,000
but it sounds like the enemy
is manipulating him.

104
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:37,000
That means we'll probably
have to fight his controller

105
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,000
to get him back to normal.

106
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:47,000
Until we do that,
until Kite's himself again,

107
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:51,000
until we can defeat the Chimera Ants,

108
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:53,000
I wanna focus on my training.

109
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,000
[Rammot yells]

110
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,000
[Killua grunts]

111
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:02,000
Yes! Yes! That's it!

112
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,000
[laughs]

113
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:07,000
Will that be okay?

114
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Huh? What the hell?

115
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,000
[yells]

116
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Damn it! I can't get enough!

117
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,000
[Illumi] Run.

118
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,000
-[gasps]
-[Illumi] Hurry.

119
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,000
[Killua] No.

120
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:35,000
-[shattering noise]
-[gasps, grunts]

121
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,000
Gon…

122
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,000
[grunts]

123
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,000
I will…

124
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,000
[laughs]

125
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,000
[Killua] …protect you.

126
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,000
Because…

127
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,000
Because we're friends!

128
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Do you hear me, Gon?

129
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:12,000
-You're my best friend!
-[gasps]

130
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,000
Stop that right now.

131
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,000
Don't look at me like that.

132
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,000
I can't hold it anymore.

133
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
I'm gonna do it.

134
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
I've gotta…

135
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,000
[Illumi] Run.

136
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,000
[Killua] Shut up!

137
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,000
[shattering noise]

138
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,000
[Illumi] Run.

139
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,000
[Killua] You can't tell me what--

140
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
[shattering]

141
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:41,000
[Illumi] Run. Run. Run.

142
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:43,000
[Killua] Shut up!

143
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
[shattering]

144
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,000
I'll just leave the head,

145
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:50,000
and I'll eat the rest!

146
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,000
[Illumi] Run.

147
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:59,000
[Killua] I don't ever want to lose him!

148
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:01,000
[yells]

149
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,000
[Illumi] Run.

150
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,000
[Killua] Gon is…

151
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,000
[Illumi] Run.

152
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:10,000
[Killua] He's my…

153
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,000
[Gon] Run.

154
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,000
[Killua] He's my best…

155
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,000
[Illumi] Run.

156
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,000
I can't do this without Killua!

157
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,000
[dramatic music playing]

158
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,000
[Killua] Gon is…

159
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,000
my best friend!

160
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,000
[yells]

161
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,000
Huh?

162
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,000
He's gone?

163
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,000
Huh.

164
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
Eh?

165
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:50,000
[chuckling]

166
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:54,000
[laughs]

167
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,000
He got me.

168
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:01,000
Damn, Illumi.

169
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,000
Why the hell didn't I catch this before?

170
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:09,000
He planted this deep inside my brain.

171
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,000
Huh? What are you saying?

172
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,000
Are you nuts?

173
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Also, how were you able to dodge that?

174
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,000
Wait. I saw the whole thing.

175
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Right as I was preparing to strike,

176
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:29,000
he stabbed his finger into his own head.

177
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,000
Then he vanished,

178
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,000
and now he's standing
right over there.

179
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,000
[Killua sighs]

180
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:38,000
I feel so much better now.

181
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:41,000
It's like I'm finally awake again.

182
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,000
No. It's more like
I've finally been freed.

183
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:47,000
[Rammot] That's all that happened, so how…

184
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:49,000
[gasps]

185
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:53,000
It has to be my imagination.

186
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:56,000
Why am I the one
who's suddenly paralyzed with fear?

187
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Now go and tell the other Ants.

188
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,000
If they even come near us,

189
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,000
they're all gonna end up dead.

190
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,000
[Rammot gasping]

191
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,000
[yelling] Why you--

192
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,000
That so?

193
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,000
[Killua] Fine. Who cares?

194
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,000
[grass rustling]

195
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,000
[panting]

196
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,000
They're gone.

197
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Their stuff's still here.

198
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,000
Wait. Did another Ant…

199
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
I don't sense any. That means…

200
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,000
[gasps]

201
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:28,000
[ominous music playing]

202
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,000
Eh?

203
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,000
What are you doing?

204
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,000
What? Can't you tell?

205
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:45,000
This is his punishment.

206
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:49,000
His punishment for hurting my feelings,
that's what!

207
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,000
Well, knock it off!

208
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:52,000
You're the one who's
being unreasonable here.

209
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,000
Can't you see that?

210
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,000
[Killua] Well, at least he's okay.

211
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,000
You just stay out of it!

212
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,000
This is none of your business!

213
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,000
Oh, yeah? Well, right back at you, idiot.

214
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Why don't you just go away?

215
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:07,000
[gasps]

216
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,000
Hmm?

217
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:16,000
Where did you get those wounds?

218
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Hmm? Oh.

219
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:20,000
I was training. Is that okay?

220
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,000
[Palm] Let me give you some more!

221
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,000
[Gon] Palm!

222
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,000
It's fine.

223
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:32,000
Your knife's pretty slow.

224
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:34,000
Could dodge it in my sleep.

225
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:36,000
[Palm groans]

226
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:38,000
I was so sure I got him.

227
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,000
[groans]

228
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,000
[yells]

229
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,000
[yelps]

230
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:50,000
[dramatic music playing]

231
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:53,000
[Palm] Come back here
so I can kill you!

232
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:56,000
[panting]

233
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:59,000
[gasping]

234
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
[gasps]

235
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,000
Oh, yeah? Well, just catch us
if you can, you idiot!

236
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,000
[dramatic music playing]

237
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,000
Wait right there, you little…

238
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:14,000
You've gotta stop, Killua.

239
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,000
Running away's only
gonna make her a lot angrier.

240
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Huh? But if we ditch her,
we won't have to see her again!

241
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,000
Look, we're gonna
have to call up Knuckle

242
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,000
and tell him that
we've gotta figure out

243
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,000
someplace else
to meet up with him and Kite.

244
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:29,000
Sorry, but I'm going back.

245
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,000
You wanna die?
'Cause that's what's gonna happen.

246
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,000
If you let your guard down,
thinking she's not much of a fighter,

247
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,000
she's gonna stab you in the back!

248
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,000
[Gon laughs]

249
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,000
No, she'd never do that.

250
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,000
[Killua] Huh? But…

251
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:44,000
didn't you just see her
take that knife to me?

252
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:47,000
Damn it, Gon! You're too much.
You know that?

253
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,000
[panting]

254
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:55,000
So you think you got the better of me?

255
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,000
[yells maniacally]

256
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:00,000
[running footsteps]

257
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,000
[yells]

258
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:03,000
[panting]

259
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,000
You think you got away?

260
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,000
You're wrong, fool.

261
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:10,000
I can find you anywhere!

262
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:14,000
[laughs]

263
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:17,000
[panting]

264
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:20,000
[breathing raggedly]

265
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:29,000
My dear, dear little mermaid,

266
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:31,000
find that infernal brat, Killua.

267
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,000
Where'd he go?

268
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:39,000
There he is, the fool.

269
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,000
The hotel by the train station.

270
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:48,000
You brat. Brat, brat, brat!

271
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:50,000
Always interrupting!

272
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:53,000
[shudders] If it weren't for him,

273
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:55,000
everything would be perfect!

274
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,000
[yells]

275
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:06,000
[laughs maniacally]

276
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:09,000
I'll hunt you down
wherever you go! I promise!

277
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:12,000
You won't beat me!

278
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,000
[shrieks]

279
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,000
[gasps]

280
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,000
Master Knov.

281
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Where did those boys run off to?

282
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,000
Oh! Right.

283
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,000
They both went to the hotel

284
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,000
that has a logo
with three circles on it.

285
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,000
[cell phone beeps]

286
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:32,000
Knov again.
They went to the Tri-Orb hotel.

287
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,000
[Morel] Yeah. As a matter of fact,

288
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,000
we just got a call from them.

289
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,000
Oh. Uh, I believe

290
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:42,000
you had planned the rendezvous
in two days?

291
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:45,000
No. We're on schedule.

292
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:47,000
We'll utilize the extra two days
to observe them,

293
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:51,000
determine if they're ready
to see Kite in his current condition.

294
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,000
[whimpering]

295
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:57,000
-But first things first, Ms. Palm.
-[Palm] Yes?

296
00:17:57,000 --> 00:18:01,000
It appears that you used your ability
without my permission.

297
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,000
[Palm shudders]

298
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:05,000
I thought I said,
"Prepare for the unexpected,

299
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,000
and just wait for my orders"?

300
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:09,000
Right.

301
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:14,000
You must realize
that your blood is a precious resource.

302
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:17,000
[gasps] Did he say, "precious"?

303
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:19,000
[dramatic music playing]

304
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:22,000
You must use it only for me.

305
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:25,000
[Palm] Yes, only for Master Knov.

306
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,000
Got it?

307
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
[Palm gasps] Yes!

308
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:34,000
[sighs]

309
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:38,000
Master Knov really
is the only one for me.

310
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,000
What's with the clothes?
It's quite a look.

311
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:44,000
Eh? This old thing?

312
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Uh, just dressing up. No reason.

313
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:48,000
[laughing nervously]

314
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:52,000
He called me precious.

315
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,000
Then just tell her to wait!

316
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:59,000
For a while, anyway,
until Kite is back to normal.

317
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,000
I already did that.

318
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,000
[groans]

319
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:09,000
[narrator] Gon Freecss,
age 12, blood type "B,"

320
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:13,000
forced to briefly "date" Palm Siberia,

321
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:15,000
age 22, blood type "A,"

322
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:18,000
then dumped without warning.

323
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:21,000
[dramatic music playing]

324
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:27,000
[shuddering]

325
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:35,000
Damn. This one again?

326
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:36,000
That's three now.

327
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,000
Hmm.

328
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:42,000
-Hmm?
-Hey! The secret one!

329
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:44,000
Huh? Are you sure?

330
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,000
Yeah! It's worth a lot.

331
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:48,000
Sell it online,
and you can make a killing.

332
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,000
Nah. You take it.

333
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:54,000
Not interested.

334
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:59,000
[laughs]

335
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,000
Did something happen?

336
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:05,000
Huh? Not really.

337
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,000
Hmm.

338
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:13,000
Now come on.
Let's go hit up the gym.

339
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,000
Sure!

340
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:22,000
[shudders]

341
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:25,000
-[Knov] How's it going?
-[gasps] Huh?

342
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,000
Fine. Nothing yet.

343
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:34,000
They seem to be doing well.

344
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:38,000
Of course, we should
continue to observe them.

345
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:41,000
They have business to attend to,
so we'll give them time.

346
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,000
[narrator] While Knov and Shoot

347
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:48,000
were observing
Gon and Killua's mental state…

348
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:58,000
Huh?

349
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,000
He's here.

350
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:11,000
[dramatic music playing]

351
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Hmm.

352
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:29,000
[grunts]

353
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:31,000
[Cheetu] Who the hell is he?

354
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:39,000
Hey, not bad.

355
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,000
[yells]

356
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,000
[both grunt]

357
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:55,000
He's fast.

358
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:02,000
You're a lot faster
than the guys from yesterday…

359
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:07,000
but not by much, I'm afraid.

360
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[closing theme music playing]

361
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:23,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

362
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:32,000
[upbeat music playing]

363
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,000
[Gon] Next time, "Grudge and Dread."

364
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:38,000
[grunts] Another order of steak, please!

365
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,000
-[Killua] You sure eat a lot.
-[Gon] Don't hold a grudge!

366
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:42,000
[Killua] That doesn't really make sense.

367
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
